.TH CRUNCH_MQ_NOTIFY 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_mq_notify \- Linux x86-64 syscall 244
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B int crunch_mq_notify(int queue, const void* event);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Registers or removes notification. Non-NULL events use the Linux kernel sigevent layout.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mq_notify (2)
